Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 我迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,让你早晨早到不为别的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了介绍新人给你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,第六战斗单位的插入生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:02:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,插入生？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.11,0:03:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗会愈发激化
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗力越多越好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.01,0:03:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不过长官 那位插入生在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然想介绍给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,今天要为大家介绍新伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.19,0:03:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,无月圣 大家要友好相处哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然打算这么介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.87,0:03:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别说友不友好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他本人在哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这集合是搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.63,0:03:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,无状况不生活
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没本人在的新人介绍都是扯淡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 毫无意义
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,正如拓斗所说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那位新人很无礼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:03:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是在责备晶你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,介绍就等下次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.07,0:03:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,今天乐队碰头吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,旋律酿中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我有社团活动
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.74,0:04:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也不在这么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真是 去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你有事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊 小屁孩么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这里非相关人员禁入哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是来见那个的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.68,0:04:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.77,0:04:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你问我也不会说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,至少要明白也有不欢迎你的人在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,小心行事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,无月圣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是圣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,再次自我介绍 我是麻黄晶 你的教官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.06,0:05:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,教官么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这么可爱的妹子是教官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.23,0:05:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,何止是幸运啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,多多关照哈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是 是 多多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,话说晶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一下子就直呼其名
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,天气也很好 去海边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,太近了 太近了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,难得来到琉球想游泳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.25,0:05:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,得向大家介绍你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,和我约会更有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了比起这个有先要做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你的身心都振奋精神的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,阳介
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,晶她不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,插入生 别做奇怪的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.19,0:06:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.03,0:06:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在和晶谈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,两人将来的话题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.27,0:06:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没在交谈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,想通过不懈地玩乐器
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,来保护晶吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道晶的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,应该比你知道她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,晶 这家伙要是靠不住
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我随时都会保护你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这次一定会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.99,0:06:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,要演出就需要新曲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,和树来写吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一句没灵感
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你形单影只
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,又待人和善
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这时
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这之后没有思路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没有灵感
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,前面的词也有问题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,遇到救星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,拓斗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,LAG的首席魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,拓斗的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,创造力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,连我都深表佩服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该没在夸我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.37,0:07:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真敏锐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就拜托你创造歌词了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,要通俗又不失高雅抒情而叉押韵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他让你写词
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为 为什么是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.47,0:07:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快救我出困境
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,坚决不帮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,叹气会让幸福跑掉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,已经跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,幸福跑了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你抓回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪呢 给我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,总感觉不得要领
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,幸福就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我能把插入生和大家融为一体吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这还用问吗 不合群的异分子就该早早剔除
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不能那样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不过那个插入生确实有点怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.93,0:08:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙隐满了什么 这是女人的直觉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.19,0:08:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可我也是女的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,最近越发有女人的直觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你又不是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也感觉到了 难道是艾比峰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.03,0:08:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,艾比峰是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我们的始祖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,最先来到这个世界的协助体
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一协助体的始祖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是什么都没感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,艾比峰的反应
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:12.75,Default - TOP,,0,0,0,,因为笨蛋南德斯很迟钝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:14.36,Default - TOP,,0,0,0,,你说啥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,与插入生有关吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一发愁就手指戳额头的习惯一点没变
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你形单影只
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,又待人和善
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.41,0:09:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,拓斗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.59,0:09:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了再走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.51,0:09:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是炖菜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没放香菇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,拓斗 我有事想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.68,0:10:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我和朋友进了某西餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我愁要点什么好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,啥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我朋友说「我点烤面条加干酪沙司」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.11,0:10:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你就听吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我也想点烤面条加干酪沙司
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是你的话会怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也刚好想点那个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一起点烤面条加干酪沙同不就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,烤面条加干酪沙司只有一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么店啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.30,0:10:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,坦率地做自己想做的最好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此「坦率地」么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.73,0:10:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,食谱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,某种意义上来说是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.48,0:10:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一股很好吃的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是奶油炖菜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不介意的话请吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我要吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:10:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是炖菜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,味道很浓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,隐藏味道是香菇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 酱油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.96,0:11:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,酱油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 拓斗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说词交给你写了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,被推给我写了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.02,0:11:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,拓斗一定能写出好词的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就算你这么说也很难
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,已经写好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.20,0:11:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们听听
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.44,0:11:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然还没完成
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.45,0:11:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你形单影只
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱又待人和善
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这时坦率地按照自己的意思行事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.54,0:11:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,果然不怎么好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不 并不差
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:12:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,对 超赞很走心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,喜 喜好因人而异
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,阳介
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是圣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得能和他融洽相处吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.28,0:12:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,说曹操曹操到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.13,0:12:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,拓斗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这前面是禁入区域
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.67,0:12:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他隐瞒了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.48,0:13:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别再接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不想被注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好难受
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.11,0:13:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,晶 他不仅仅是个插入生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Dirigent好像没有变化
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.80,0:13:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,和平时一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dirigent
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,之前提到那个男人已经到位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还打算接近艾比峰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要是如石寺所想的那样进行会很麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,监视不要松懈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.69,0:13:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是 对了 准备进行得如何了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,东京体制正在稳步进行中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.82,0:13:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好不容易熟悉了琉球
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.16,0:14:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,琉球只不过是为此争取时间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.33,0:14:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,东京的防卫最优先
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是打算舍弃这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看情况
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.42,0:14:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.69,0:14:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,协助体的始祖么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,香蕉头和那家伙有着什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.03,0:14:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一发愁就用手指戳额头的习惯一点没变
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 我感觉圣不是坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.70,0:14:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你不怀疑他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信他的清白才去追的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能做到这个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:15:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,料理也是直到完成才知道好不好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.55,0:15:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但只要相信会好吃就能最终完成
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,相信很重要 晶是正确的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.73,0:15:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我又有精神了 因为稍微有点泄气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,舍弃琉球 将机能向东京转移
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.23,0:15:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,究竟把我们当什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是人类间互撕的时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:43.27,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\1a&HFF&\t(0,1000,\1a&H00&)\1c&H000000&\pos(960,1032)}红伤骑士X
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,移动完毕 北纬30度 东经131度
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,种子岛宇宙中心红色噪音确认
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,中心内部红色结界已经展开
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,确认敌方为多头战斗型
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一上来就是个大危机
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.87,0:16:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,批准骑士共鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,骑士出发完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,究竟是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不来袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.65,0:16:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,敌方战斗型停止战斗思考
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有进行重造
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不攻击只是瞎转悠吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.41,0:16:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,理由尚不明确
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,张这么巨大的结界是打算做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.75,0:16:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是个陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,圣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.59,0:16:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你来干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:17:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我想来参观学习下前辈们出色的战斗方式
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是提到的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.35,0:17:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.69,0:17:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,让我见识见识玩乐器之外的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.44,0:17:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,敌方战斗型逐渐向火箭周围集结
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这很糟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.12,0:17:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,快去干掉它们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,它们打算进入火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.87,0:17:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,雷达有反应
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.87,0:17:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭中粗黑_GBK}是{\fn方正大标宋_GBK}I{\fn方正兰亭中粗黑_GBK}级
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,确认入侵略型
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.55,0:17:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有红色噪音反应范围扩大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是重造开始的前兆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人也认真起来了 作战开始
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,究竟发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.49,0:18:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,和高机动型的敌人碰撞这家伙怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,无法捕捉动态
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,拓斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.17,0:18:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,在 在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.51,0:18:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,拓斗 在身后
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,发什么呆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,一点都不像你 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不是聊天时候
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,到处都是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.11,0:18:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,在艰苦奋战呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.78,0:18:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我的话会一头头引开解决掉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不 那种做法太老套了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那你打算怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.12,0:18:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,将不明生物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,消灭在摇篮里最明智
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.46,0:18:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,阳介 好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,火箭应该有助推器
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,只要点燃那里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:18:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,强火便会猛燃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.64,0:19:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧 晶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们能做到 谁离得最近
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.47,0:19:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,和树
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.65,0:19:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,正确
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.57,0:19:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,全员支援5号
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,和树打算干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.24,0:19:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,轰燃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不要让敌人靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.16,0:19:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你形单影只可爱又待人和善
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这时炸药轰燃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,提问凌乱的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.59,0:19:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬间收拾好的方法是最终答案为
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是的约定的按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,等下还在战斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,下达周围十公里紧急避难提示
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 5号
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,请迅速撤离
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.11,0:19:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,还在对战中不是做这个的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.03,0:20:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,全员撤离完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一下子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那个笨蛋已经按下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,得赶快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.95,0:20:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真让人操心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不是悠哉悠哉的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,红 红色噪音反应全部消失
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.63,0:20:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,周围没有敌踪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗结束
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,大家呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.06,0:20:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.23,0:20:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还以为会死呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.57,0:20:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那时炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,轰燃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.57,0:20:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这词不行 我可不会唱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.24,0:20:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 不
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.16,0:20:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,阳介
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你相信 我们就不会输
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.93,0:21:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他们这次这样做 没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.95,0:21:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才需要在第五战斗单位有实战经验的你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.27,0:21:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,说得真随便
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,茶泡饭 你竟然在这 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我可一直在找你呢 净让人担心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.46,0:21:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,猫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.37,0:21:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,它叫茶泡饭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,茶泡饭 名字真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.38,0:21:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱 乖啦 乖啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.88,0:21:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖 真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见 艾比峰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:21:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.23,0:22:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,沉默不语倒是一点没变
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.57,0:22:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你有力量
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.40,0:22:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这次一定要为保护晶而用
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.58,0:23:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,快来看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.50,0:23:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,听说了吗他们要开演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.34,0:23:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,会是怎样的演出呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.59,0:23:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,也有怪怪的客人来 真让人期待
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.92,0:23:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,下集
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.51,0:23:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,「我们这代人」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.59,0:23:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢节庆了
